# qxa test artifacts. Everything under test-output/ is REGENERATED by every
# suite run (renders, and screenshots that capture the whole desktop because
# the screenshot action grabs the root window, not the app window). Two such
# desktop captures reached the remote before this rule existed.
smaragd/test-output/

# Steinberg ASIO SDK — licensed, NOT redistributable (unlike the clap/vst3
# submodules), so it is a manual drop-in: unzip the SDK from steinberg.net to
# smaragd/third_party/asiosdk. It must never be committed.
smaragd/third_party/asiosdk/
# Hand-made scratch audio at the repo root. Named individually ON PURPOSE: a
# blanket *.wav / *.ogg would also match render.wav and test_sawtooth.wav, which
# ARE tracked here and are fixtures the qxa cases depend on.
/testspur.wav
/testspur.ogg

# The proposal 44 verification probe, built at the repo root by
# smaragd/tw303a/sidecar/tools/build_body_probe.sh. A BINARY, and it was
# committed once by an over-broad `git add -A` before this line existed.
/body_probe
